{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0ae43333f9e0e0bb","x":-1120,"y":-360,"width":2520,"height":1560,"type":"text","text":"``` mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant Form as TextToSpeechForm\n    participant tRPC as tRPC Client\n    participant Server as tRPC Server\n    participant DB as Prisma (Database)\n    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2\n    participant TTS as Chatterbox API\n    participant AudioAPI as /api/audio/[id]\n    Note over User,Form: 1. 用户填写表单并点击生成\n    User->>Form: 点击生成按钮\n    Form->>tRPC: mutateAsync({ text, voiceId, temperature, topP, topK, repetitionPenalty })\n    \n    Note over tRPC,Server: 2. tRPC 路由到 generations.create\n    tRPC->>Server: generations.create mutation\n    Server->>DB: prisma.voice.findUnique({ id: voiceId })\n    DB-->>Server: voice (包含 r2ObjectKey)\n    Note over Server,TTS: 3. 调用 TTS API 生成音频\n    Server->>TTS: POST /generate { prompt, voice_key, temperature, ... }\n    TTS-->>Server: ArrayBuffer (音频数据)\n    Note over Server,R2: 4. 保存到 R2 存储\n    Server->>DB: prisma.generation.create({ ... })\n    Server->>R2: uploadAudio({ buffer, key })\n    Server->>DB: prisma.generation.update({ r2ObjectKey })\n    Server-->>Form: 返回 { id: generationId }\n    Note over Form,User: 5. 跳转到详情页\n    Form->>User: router.push(`/text-to-speech/${id}`)\n    Note over User,AudioAPI: 6. 前端请求音频\n    User->>AudioAPI: GET /api/audio/[id]\n    AudioAPI->>DB: prisma.generation.findUnique({ id })\n    \n    DB-->>AudioAPI: generation (包含 r2ObjectKey)\n    \n    AudioAPI->>R2: getSignedAudioUrl(r2ObjectKey)\n    R2-->>AudioAPI: signedUrl\n    \n    AudioAPI->>R2: fetch(signedUrl)\n    R2-->>AudioAPI: audio stream\n    \n    AudioAPI-->>User: 返回音频 (Content-Type: audio/wav)\n```"},
		{"id":"88860f5a613b5172","x":-1240,"y":1360,"width":2760,"height":1520,"type":"text","text":"``` mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Form as 前端 Form 组件\n    participant Hook as useTRPC Hook\n    participant L as httpBatchLink\n    participant API as /api/trpc/[trpc]\n    participant Handler as fetchRequestHandler\n    participant Router as appRouter\n    participant Middleware as orgProcedure 中间件\n    participant Logic as generations.create\n\n    Note over Form, L: 1. 客户端调用\n    Form->>Hook: trpc.generations.create.mutateAsync({ text, voiceId, ... })\n    Hook->>L: 调用 tRPC Client\n\n    Note over L, API: 2. HTTP 请求\n    L->>API: POST /api/trpc/generations.create<br/>Body: { json: { text, voiceId, ... } }\n\n    Note over API, Handler: 3. API 路由处理\n    API->>Handler: fetchRequestHandler({ req, router, createContext })\n\n    Note over Handler, Router: 4. 路由匹配\n    Handler->>Router: 解析路径 \"generations.create\"\n    Router->>Router: 匹配到 generationsRouter.create\n\n    Note over Router, Middleware: 5. 中间件验证\n    Router->>Middleware: 执行 orgProcedure 中间件\n    Middleware->>Middleware: auth() 获取 userId, orgId\n\n    alt 验证通过\n        Middleware->>Logic: next({ ctx: { userId, orgId } })\n    else 验证失败\n        Middleware-->>Form: 抛出 TRPCError (UNAUTHORIZED/FORBIDDEN)\n    end\n\n    Note over Logic, Form: 6. 执行逻辑并返回\n    Logic->>Logic: 验证 voice → 调用 TTS API → 上传 R2 → 保存 DB\n    Logic-->>Form: 返回 { id: \"gen_xxx\" }\n\n    Note over Form: 7. 跳转页面\n    Form->>Form: router.push(`/text-to-speech/${data.id}`)\n```"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}